# #152 drills and multi-hit aerials: Shadow Hunter's glaive drill. Shadow Hunter a against Shadow Hunter b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero shadow hunter
# Both dash in, close.
40 b stick -1 0
42 b stick 0 0
50 a stick 1 0
52 a stick 0 0
# The glaive drill on a standing b.
100 a tap B 8
101 a stick 0.6 0
123 a cstick 0 -1
124 a stick 0 0
127 a cstick 0 0
# Frames saved on hits (native only; illustration for the look box).
131 a capture
151 a capture
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): the aerial starts, then every hit.
#! expect a 123 applied attack 1 style 16
#! expect b 131 damage 2.000
#! expect b 136 damage 4.000
#! expect b 141 damage 6.000
#! expect b 146 damage 8.000
#! expect b 151 damage 12.000
#! scene a ShadowHunterMissile
#! scene a CleaveDamageTarget
# View held a second, twice: the moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
